ts.test_rate_limit_config#test_sign_in_survives_a_production_deployment_with_no_salt"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>The reported outage, as a test.</p>\n<pre><code>A production deployment with no RATE_LIMIT_SALT used to answer every\ncredential POST with 429, so nobody could sign in and the site told them\nthey had tried too often. The login quota degrades now, so the request\nreaches verification and is judged on the credential itself — 401 here,\nbecause this one is not a Google token. Any status but 429 is the point.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"a79d49fdbe3911bd3faf2d24df09b6b0","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"603ccf3c8df91878aa03619e5d951f6b","type":"before","name":"production","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"2400be83cf9c99a1c281b54ce55b3ecd","type":"before","name":"isolated_auth","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"ea034dfd6b7d5d0d954465106b784614","type":"before","name":"_asyncio_loop_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"1b1af5b4e7a5fc31e9409b72407c0439","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":3},{"id":"e2a4ab8a71785a2081f30f10aebd1856","type":"before","name":"meaningful_test_report","status":"passed","steps":[{"stepId":"08f01f6f10562606624a25a0fd39eda9","name":"Given isolated backend conditions for “test_sign_in_survives_a_production_deployment_with_no_salt”","status":"passed","steps":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"e7de82642cfb0509c59049707d1e684c","originalFileName":"82bfee56-1dc2-4239-b8b5-ed18992b8449-attachment.json","ext":".json","contentType":"application/json","contentLength":271,"name":"starting-conditions.json"},"type":"attachment"}],"parameters":[],"start":1787655042327,"stop":1787655042327,"duration":0,"type":"step","hasSimilarErrorInSubSteps":false},{"stepId":"d1086593fe084e96a79df296ffe23dee","name":"When the test executes its actions and assertions","status